Hansard model artifact - third-party model attribution
======================================================

This artifact contains no Hansard code. It is a bundle of third-party machine
learning models, redistributed under their own licences and reproduced here
byte-for-byte from the sources recorded in deploy/docker/models.manifest.
Every file is verified against a pinned SHA-256 at build time and again at pod
start (models.verifyChecksums).

One ASR model serves BOTH French and English. There is no per-language model,
no per-language deployment, and no language tag required at inference time.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Automatic speech recognition
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Model      NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6b v3 (multilingual, 25 European
              languages including French and English)
   Files      nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3/
   Origin     NVIDIA Corporation, https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
   ONNX build https://huggingface.co/istupakov/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-onnx
   Licence    Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)
              https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

   ATTRIBUTION, as required by CC-BY-4.0 section 3(a):
       "Parakeet TDT 0.6b v3" (c) NVIDIA Corporation, licensed under
       CC-BY-4.0. Converted to ONNX and quantized to int8 by istupakov.
       Redistributed unmodified as part of the Hansard model artifact.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Voice activity detection
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Model      Silero VAD
   Files      silero/silero_vad.onnx
   Origin     Silero Team, https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad
   ONNX build https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/silero-vad
   Licence    MIT (full text in silero/LICENSE)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Speaker segmentation (diarization)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Model      pyannote segmentation 3.0, int8 ONNX export
   Files      sherpa-onnx-pyannote-segmentation-3-0/model.int8.onnx
   Origin     pyannote.audio, exported by the k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx project
   Licence    MIT (full text in sherpa-onnx-pyannote-segmentation-3-0/LICENSE)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. Speaker embedding (diarization)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Model      3D-Speaker CAM++ speaker verification, VoxCeleb 16 kHz
   Files      3dspeaker_speech_campplus_sv_en_voxceleb_16k.onnx
   Origin     Alibaba DAMO Academy 3D-Speaker, redistributed by k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx
   Licence    Apache License 2.0

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundle
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Total size  ~0.71 GB uncompressed
   Integrity   SHA256SUMS in the artifact root covers every file above.
   Runtime     Nothing in this artifact is fetched at pod start. The workers
               run with HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1, TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE=1 and
               HANSARD_RUNTIME__ALLOW_MODEL_DOWNLOADS=false.
